key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-25T13:41:21-08:00","id":1162543,"title":"","content":"Mages have tons of capabilities to impact elections.<br /> <br /> Correspondence or Data --spy on the voters. When combined with other spheres, you can impact voters at a distance, either directly by summoning them 'Everyone go and vote for candidate X' or indirectly by using Entropy (manipulate probability so bad stuff or good stuff happens to the voters you want to control) Forces (electronic voting machine manipulation) Matter (chads are hanging or not) and I'll leave the rest for your thoughts.<br /> <br /> Forces will alter all sorts of electronic things, light and sound. The right illusions could be very useful, as could machine sabotage.<br /> <br /> Mind could be used to create subconscious desire to vote a specific way or to read minds.<br /> <br /> Probably intelligent and organized supernatural groups would use PACs and other groups to funnel money to the right candidates for their schemes and use various political action groups to promote their agenda.<br /> <br /> So, except for the cool powers, politics in the WoD wouldn't be all that different than in our world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder","name":"baakyocalder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13680_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-25T16:11:10-08:00","id":1162569,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</st